      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing at approximately 0.6–0.7 Tm for 1–10 hours is an appropriate processing window for producing nanoscale ordering without full phase separation.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed material will contain nanoscale chemically ordered regions embedded in a disordered fcc matrix.",
